{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling","id":1413157,"title":"Help my find/create ways for a kinain to become a changeling","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-11T21:20:32-07:00","id":1413157,"title":"Help my find/create ways for a kinain to become a changeling","content":"Recently I have begun to think about kinains becoming changeling. Many kinain probably would want to if it was a possibility. Just like changelings dream about becoming a siochain, or vampire fantasies about reaching golconda.<br /> <br /> <br /> The only official way that I can think of is for the kinain to become a keremet. But I don't think there is any other way. But this is not a problem, Im willing to create a way (or at least a legend) for how this might happen.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> In you opnion, which ways a kinain could use to become a changeling? I suppose it must be something big and hard to achieve, something that can take a entire chronicle to do.<br /> <br /> <br /> So far I've been thinking about this options but I still don't know to wrap up the details<br /> <br /> <br /> - The kinain must help a lost one achieve balance again, in the process becoming one with it, and in turn, a changeling. But how?<br /> <br /> - A kinan can be &quot;uplifted&quot; by a higher fae being, like a god, or a firstborn. But why would one do it?<br /> <br /> - It must find arcadia (which in turn can only be found by a kinain), but why would this make it turn into a changeling?<br /> <br /> -A changeling can make a pact with a kinain, surrendering their will and memories to the kinain so after his death the kinain will take his mantle as a changeling. But why a changeling would do that?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T21:39:52-07:00","id":1413161,"title":"","content":"In Dark Age Fae Mortals could become fae by spending too long in Faery, this happened with mortal babies stolen who became changelings, but mortal servants that served Fae Lords in their Holdings would also become Changelings.<br /> <br /> So you could have Kinain who essentially sell their Souls to Arcadia, and they return having spent 100 years and a day in Arcadia, with perhaps only a year passing in the Mortal World.<br /> <br /> I also have the Tithed, the souls that the Sidhe booted to steal the bodies of, become new Fae in Arcadia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T22:28:47-07:00","id":1413167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413161#post1413161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In Dark Age Fae Mortals could become fae by spending too long in Faery, this happened with mortal babies stolen who became changelings, but mortal servants that served Fae Lords in their Holdings would also become Changelings.<br /> <br /> So you could have Kinain who essentially sell their Souls to Arcadia, and they return having spent 100 years and a day in Arcadia, with perhaps only a year passing in the Mortal World.<br /> <br /> I also have the Tithed, the souls that the Sidhe booted to steal the bodies of, become new Fae in Arcadia.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Very interesting idea about the tithed, but they are not really kinain are they? But the idea of becoming changeling by spending a long time in the dreaming or near changelings is more akin to lost, not dreaming. There are exaple PCs in the enchanted book about a mortal that spend years in the dreaming and now is out of touch with the human world. So that probably not a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-11T22:53:23-07:00","id":1413169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rucun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413167#post1413167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> Very interesting idea about the tithed, but they are not really kinain are they? But the idea of becoming changeling by spending a long time in the dreaming or near changelings is more akin to lost, not dreaming. There are exaple PCs in the enchanted book about a mortal that spend years in the dreaming and now is out of touch with the human world. So that probably not a thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>All those Rip Van Winkles are post Dark Ages, in the days of the Dark Ages though before the Dreaming left the Autumn World it was a thing. And it was explicitly more common with babies with humans that formed their personalities and world views seeming to need much more time. I would require the Deep Dreaming like Arcadia itself as necessary for such a process of becoming a changeling.<br /> <br /> The Sidhe did seem to choose ordinary mortals, however some have theorized that they may have been the centuries long removed descendants of Sidhe Kinain as a possible link.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-12T04:25:09-07:00","id":1413196,"title":"","content":"In the official LARP book it said a long and hard quest into the dreaming might be able to have a Kinan turn into a Changling.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-12T04:49:02-07:00","id":1413201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413196#post1413196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In the official LARP book it said a long and hard quest into the dreaming might be able to have a Kinan turn into a Changling.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh interesting I never read any of the MET books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-12T14:34:50-07:00","id":1413278,"title":"","content":"They also flat out say in Minds eye theatre that Piskies were those tithed souls and that they will die if their sidhe counterparts die but the sidhe would only feel a fleeting sadness if their piskey died before them.... It contradicts everything about the piskies and it just comes off as lazy writing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3239-jane_dargason","name":"Jane_Dargason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3239_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-12T14:51:01-07:00","id":1413282,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jane_Dargason</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413278#post1413278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They also flat out say in Minds eye theatre that Piskies were those tithed souls and that they will die if their sidhe counterparts die but the sidhe would only feel a fleeting sadness if their piskey died before them.... It contradicts everything about the piskies and it just comes off as lazy writing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wait really?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-12T16:57:43-07:00","id":1413295,"title":"","content":"I think we need to look bigger.<br /> <br /> The Changeling Way is that if a Commoner or Autumn Sidhe Fae dies they get reincarnated into a new body in their bloodline, but there is some sort of soul-merging involved in some explanations, isn't there? So potentially there's a one in a million chance of something getting muxed up and instead of incarnating in a newborn, they latch onto and meld with a mortal soul that is not being born but is perhaps returning from a near-death experience?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26403-ragnell","name":"Ragnell","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T10:02:47-07:00","id":1413390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jane_Dargason</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413278#post1413278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They also flat out say in Minds eye theatre that Piskies were those tithed souls and that they will die if their sidhe counterparts die but the sidhe would only feel a fleeting sadness if their piskey died before them.... It contradicts everything about the piskies and it just comes off as lazy writing.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don\u2019t think it\u2019s much lazy writing as a alternate continuity","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T10:54:41-07:00","id":1413399,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jane_Dargason</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413278#post1413278\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They also flat out say in Minds eye theatre that Piskies were those tithed souls and that they will die if their sidhe counterparts die but the sidhe would only feel a fleeting sadness if their piskey died before them.... It contradicts everything about the piskies and it just comes off as lazy writing.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I wouldn't say lazy so much as WTF. If the Pisky and Sidhe touch do they merge? Is it like Dark Crystal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T12:30:57-07:00","id":1413420,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413399#post1413399\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> I wouldn't say lazy so much as WTF. If the Pisky and Sidhe touch do they merge? Is it like Dark Crystal?</div> </div> </div> </div>If so I would so make the sidhe into Skeksis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3239-jane_dargason","name":"Jane_Dargason","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3239_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T13:15:40-07:00","id":1413428,"title":"","content":"Random thought<br /> <br /> It seems like C:tD and C:tL are two different ways the faerie myth could have gone from its foundations in Dark Ages: Fae, with Dreaming being the Light path (all sweetness and light, or at least more sweetness and light than C:tL) and Lost being the Dark path. Two different paths diverging around the time of the Shattering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-13T13:59:45-07:00","id":1413439,"title":"","content":"I get that, like a common misconception is that ancient Faeries where just a bunch of horrid Demons that all loved murdering people.<br /> <br /> Which isn\u2019t true in the slightest. Their where more complex characters some good some bad and some neutral.<br /> <br /> Like even in the archetypical nasty faerie story. The Changling, it\u2019s ofen said that the faeries would take their kids back if their being horribly abused, which was better then the humans at the time.<br /> <br /> Not to mention the Selkie stories where a man steals a women way of escape forces her away from her family and rapes her repeatedly.<br /> <br /> Lots of shapeshifitng lover stories are like gross.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-14T17:04:32-07:00","id":1413656,"title":"","content":"Well, just off the top of my head... <br /> A Kinain wanting to become Fae, could get his hands on a Selkie skin.<br /> Alternately, a Kinain could go to the underwater in the Dreaming, to the deepest of the Eternal sea, and strike a deal with Vatea to gain an Apsara...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10198-luisarmander","name":"Luisarmander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-17T09:03:10-07:00","id":1414214,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Luisarmander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413656#post1413656\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, just off the top of my head...<br /> A Kinain wanting to become Fae, could get his hands on a Selkie skin.<br /> Alternately, a Kinain could go to the underwater in the Dreaming, to the deepest of the Eternal sea, and strike a deal with Vatea to gain an Apsara...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Other Kiths might have Phylacteries... especially if they were in past life a Lich... of course the question then becomes is the new Changeling REALLY the old Kinain...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-20T18:51:03-07:00","id":1414856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragnell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1413295#post1413295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think we need to look bigger.<br /> <br /> The Changeling Way is that if a Commoner or Autumn Sidhe Fae dies they get reincarnated into a new body in their bloodline, but there is some sort of soul-merging involved in some explanations, isn't there? So potentially there's a one in a million chance of something getting muxed up and instead of incarnating in a newborn, they latch onto and meld with a mortal soul that is not being born but is perhaps returning from a near-death experience?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's actually a very elegant solution! A Kinain could then go through a Chrysalis. I'd give the Kinain character a Kith, but a high level of Remembrance. Although if someone is Kinain they don't have a fae soul... yet. Right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/412-valismedsen","name":"valismedsen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar412_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-21T16:11:31-07:00","id":1414983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>valismedsen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1413157-help-my-find-create-ways-for-a-kinain-to-become-a-changeling?p=1414856#post1414856\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That's actually a very elegant solution! A Kinain could then go through a Chrysalis. I'd give the Kinain character a Kith, but a high level of Remembrance. Although if someone is Kinain they don't have a fae soul... yet. Right?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> as of the player's guide there are two kith